description: |
  **What to produce:** Replace GUIInfoManager's 700-line if/else chain (TranslateSingleString) with a data-driven lookup table in a new CInfoLabelRegistry class.
  **The problem:** Lines ~10600-11300 of GUIInfoManager.cpp contain:
  ```cpp
  if (StringUtils::EqualsNoCase(strCondition, "Player.HasAudio"))
    return PLAYER_HAS_AUDIO;
  else if (StringUtils::EqualsNoCase(strCondition, "Player.HasVideo"))
    return PLAYER_HAS_VIDEO;
  // ... 300+ more conditions
  ```
  **The solution:**
  ```cpp
  // InfoLabelRegistry.h
  class CInfoLabelRegistry {
  public:
    static int LookupLabel(const std::string& label);
    static int LookupBoolCondition(const std::string& condition);
  private:
    static const std::unordered_map<std::string, int> s_labelMap;
    static const std::unordered_map<std::string, int> s_boolMap;
  };
  ```
  **Architecture:**
  - New files: `xbmc/guilib/guiinfo/InfoLabelRegistry.h`, `xbmc/guilib/guiinfo/InfoLabelRegistry.cpp`
  - Extract every `if/else if` condition from TranslateSingleString into s_labelMap and s_boolMap
  - GUIInfoManager::TranslateSingleString() becomes: `return CInfoLabelRegistry::LookupLabel(label)`
  - Case-insensitive lookup (store lowercase keys, lowercase input before lookup)
  **This is the highest-ROI refactoring in the entire codebase:** 700 lines of branching → 300 lines of data + 10 lines of lookup. O(n) string comparison → O(1) hash lookup. And every future label addition is one line of data, not another else-if branch.
  **Acceptance criteria:**
  - All 300+ info labels extracted into the registry
  - TranslateSingleString is reduced to a delegation call
  - Lookup is case-insensitive
  - Phase 1 GUIInfoManager tests still pass (51 tests)
  - Labels that take parameters (Container(x).ListItem(n).Property) are NOT in the registry — those go through InfoExpressionParser (separate bead)
  **What NOT to do:**
  - Don't extract info providers (separate bead)
  - Don't change label ID values
  - Don't change how parameters are parsed — only the simple label→ID mapping
  - Don't break existing skin XML parsing
